Package: omahab
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: nodejs, init-system-helpers (>= 1.18~)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Omahab Release <davidgilesgt@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/davidgilesgt/omahab
Description: Omahab home server control plane
 Omahab is an opinionated home server environment: a paved road over
 standard infrastructure. This package ships the omahab CLI, the omahabd
 host control-plane daemon, its systemd units, and the platform catalog.
 Host installation is driven by the signed installer from
 https://github.com/davidgilesgt/omahab; this package is the upgrade
 channel for an installed appliance.
